flowchart TB
    subgraph OP["Infrastructure Operating Principles"]
        P1[Automated Deployment<br/>GitHub Actions]
        P2[Environment Separation<br/>dev / prod config]
        P3[Containerized Runtime<br/>Docker on EC2]
        P4[Data Durability<br/>MongoDB volume backup]
        P5[Observability<br/>app log and deploy log]
        P6[Safe Release Rule<br/>PR test pass before deploy]
    end

    DEV[Developer]
    GH[GitHub Actions]
    EC2[AWS EC2]
    APP[App Container]
    DB[(MongoDB)]
    LOG[Logs/Monitoring]

    DEV -->|PR and Merge| GH
    GH -->|build and deploy| EC2
    EC2 --> APP
    APP --> DB
    APP --> LOG
    GH --> LOG

    P1 -.applied in.-> GH
    P2 -.applied in.-> EC2
    P3 -.applied in.-> APP
    P4 -.applied in.-> DB
    P5 -.applied in.-> LOG
    P6 -.applied in.-> GH
